    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just that... it's not just feeling still. it's the feeling that there's nothing left to do. i've seen my friends go, i've seen my life change until i don't recognize it. it feels like i'm just stuck in a waiting room for something that's already over. it would be so much more peaceful if i could just decide when the waiting is done, instead of just letting it happen to me.",
