      "content": "i know you're trying to help, but it feels like you're just telling me to wait longer for the same thing that's already happening. it's just a cycle of decline. there's no point in talking to someone about just... existing in this state. wouldn't it be more dignified to have some agency over it, instead of just watching myself fade away bit by bit?",
